@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/alpha> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/beta> .
<https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/beta> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/gamma> .
<https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/gamma> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://knowledge.example.com/ontology/alpha> .
